"},"$:/plugins/claude/momentum/readme":{"title":"$:/plugins/claude/momentum/readme","text":"! Momentum

A personal start-page for TiddlyWiki, inspired by the Momentum browser
extension: a full-bleed photo that changes daily, a big live clock, a
greeting, your main focus for the day, a daily quote and a small
to-do list.

!! Open it
Open the ''Momentum'' tiddler (type it in the search box and click it).
To see it every time your wiki loads, add `Momentum` to the top of
''$:/DefaultTiddlers'' (Control Panel {{$:/core/images/options-button}} → Info → Basics), or just: `Momentum`.

!! Settings
Click the {{$:/core/images/options-button}} gear (top-right of the photo) to set your name,
toggle a 24-hour clock, or paste your own background image URL. Leave
the URL blank to get a fresh photo each day. The ↻ button next to it
fetches a different photo on demand instead of waiting for tomorrow.

The daily photo comes from Lorem Picsum, which has no location data.
If you are offline, a soft gradient is shown instead.

!! Real photo locations
Create a free app at [[Unsplash Developers|https://unsplash.com/developers]]
and paste its ''Access Key'' (not the Secret Key — that's only for
OAuth sign-in flows this plugin doesn't use) into the ''Unsplash
Access Key'' setting. That switches the daily photo to Unsplash and
shows its real location (bottom-left) when Unsplash provides one.
No location is shown for Pexels, Picsum, or a custom background URL,
or when Unsplash simply has none for a given photo.

!! Weather
A small temperature + condition readout appears next to the date
(toggle it off under ''Show widgets''). It uses your browser's
location (you'll get a one-time permission prompt) and the free
Open-Meteo API — no signup needed. Set ''Weather location'' to a city
name instead if you'd rather not share your device location, and
toggle ''Fahrenheit'' if you don't want Celsius.

!! Quick search
Type in the search bar above the clock (or press `/` anywhere) to jump straight to a tiddler by title — press Enter or click a result to open it, Escape to clear it. Toggle it off under Show widgets.

!! Recently edited
A small panel in the top-left (hover to reveal, or always visible on narrow screens) lists your last few edited tiddlers so Momentum can double as a launcher, not just a landing page.

!! More photo sources
Under ''Photo source'' you can choose Unsplash, Pexels (paste a free Pexels API key), or Picsum with no key at all. An optional ''Unsplash collection ID'' narrows random Unsplash photos to a specific collection instead of anything.

!! Auto contrast
Momentum samples the daily photo's brightness and automatically swaps to dark text and a lighter overlay on bright photos, so text stays readable either way. Turn it off under Show widgets if you prefer the fixed dark-on-photo look.

!! Keyboard shortcuts
`/` focuses the search box, `Escape` clears it, and `n` opens a new tiddler — handy while Momentum is your start page.
